#: about/faq.rst:399
#, fuzzy
msgid "Is it possible to use Rebel Engine to create non-game applications?"
msgstr "Можно ли использовать Godot для создания не игровых приложений?"

#: about/faq.rst:401
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Yes! Reble Engine features an extensive built-in UI system, and its small "
