#: getting_started/step_by_step/scripting_player_input.rst:180
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In summary, every script in Rebel Engine represents a class and extends one "
"of the engine's built-in classes. The node types your classes inherit from "
"give you access to properties like ``rotation`` and ``position`` in our "
"sprite's case. You also inherit many functions, which we didn't get to use "
