#: tutorials/math/matrices_and_transforms.rst:199
msgid ""
"Note that in 3D, Rebel Engine has a separate :ref:`class_Basis` structure "
"for holding the three :ref:`class_Vector3` values of the basis, since the "
"code can get complex and it makes sense to separate it from :ref:"
"`class_Transform` (which is composed of one :ref:`class_Basis` and one "
"extra :ref:`class_Vector3` for the origin)."
