#: tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:403
#: tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:432
#: tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:834
#: tutorials/shaders/shaders_style_guide.rst:67
#: tutorials/shaders/shaders_style_guide.rst:86
