"into the fragment shader for you. A few of these have no equivalents in "
"Rebel Shading Language because Rebel has chosen not to make them available "
"by default. This is okay because Rebel Shading Language gives you the "
"ability to make your own uniforms. For variables whose equivalents are "
"listed as \"Provide with Uniform\", users are responsible for creating that "
"uniform themselves. The description gives the reader a hint about what they "
"can pass in as a substitute."
